================================================================================

This distribution includes the following third-party libraries. They are grouped
by which build actually ships them, because the two differ substantially: the
desktop launcher carries LWJGL and SQLite and the APK carries neither, and the
APK carries AndroidX and the Android backend and the desktop build carries
neither.

